error[E0070]: the type alias `Ping` refers to itself
 --> tests/ui/03-types/aliases/alias_cycle.cheby:6:10
  |
6 | pub type Ping = Option<Pong>
  |          ^^^^          ---- which leads back to it through this alias
  |
  = note: the aliases form a cycle: `Ping` → `Pong` → `Ping`
  = help: an alias never finishes expanding if it contains itself; declare a type for a recursive structure (§4.4)

